japanese_game_company(creator_zelda). @ "A Japanese game company created the game the Legend of Zelda."
created(creator_zelda, zelda). @ "A Japanese game company created the game the Legend of Zelda."
on_top10(G) & game(G) => made_by_japanese_company(G). @ "All games on the Top 10 list are made by Japanese game companies."
sold_more_than_one_million(G) => on_top10(G). @ "If a game sells more than one million copies, then it will be included in the Top 10 list."
sold_more_than_one_million(zelda). @ "The Legend of Zelda sold more than one million copies."
? on_top10(zelda).
